  "rationale": "The observed counterexamples reveal critical failures in tenant isolation (stock leakage across tenants), idempotency (retries consuming stock), payload binding (conflicts ignored), and validation (negative/invalid types accepted). The new test suite addresses these by: 1) Verifying strict tenant isolation for stock counts and reservation keys; 2) Testing idempotency after releases to ensure no double-restoration or double-consumption; 3) Enforcing payload binding conflicts when SKU or Qty changes under the same key; 4) Validating boundary conditions for quantity (0, float, >10); 5) Ensuring release errors on non-existent reservations do not affect state.",
